{%- doc -%}
  Renders a dimensional, brand-neutral gift box image used as a placeholder
  wherever a product has no real photo yet (product cards, product media
  gallery). Original artwork — no third-party branding, so it's always safe to
  ship in a demo store. A wrapped box works across any product category
  (beauty, accessories, kitchen, etc.) rather than implying a specific one.

  @param {string} [class] - additional CSS classes for the <img>

  @example
  {% render 'placeholder-bottle', class: 'media-block__placeholder' %}
{%- enddoc -%}
<img
  src="{{ 'product-box-neutral.png' | asset_url }}"
  class="placeholder-bottle {{ class }}"
  alt="{{ 'content.placeholder_image' | t }}"
  loading="lazy"
  width="900"
  height="1125"
>

{% stylesheet %}
  .placeholder-bottle {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
